WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.231
Today's experiment: scale the environment.

00:00:05.078 --> 00:00:09.002
Work in order, state on the card.

00:00:09.002 --> 00:00:13.012
That's long-horizon coordination.

00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:18.126
Freeze. State recovery, execute.

00:00:19.904 --> 00:00:23.017
The recovery came… at scale.

00:00:23.017 --> 00:00:27.381
Progress: verified. Completion… still pending.

00:00:27.381 --> 00:00:31.017
The state log didn't miss a single one.

00:00:31.017 --> 00:00:37.417
Scale here, and it's our electricity bill that moves — not somebody else's meter.

